; UnifiedTrader_EA - default preset
; In MT5: Strategy Tester > Expert Advisor: UnifiedTrader_EA > Inputs tab > Load
; or on the chart's EA Inputs dialog > Load.
;
; Ships with BOTH sources disabled - you must explicitly enable
; InpEnableTelegramSignals and/or InpEnableClaudeManagement. If enabling
; Telegram, also set InpBotToken/InpChannelId1 (see the .mq5 file header for
; setup steps). If enabling Claude management, InpClaudeMagicNumber MUST
; match ../../../ClaudeSMC_Trader/python/config.py's AdvisorConfig.magic
; (both default 20260921). Ships with InpDryRun=true; only flip it once you
; trust the log output for how it wants to act.
;
; InpExitStyle applies to InpClaudeMagicNumber positions ONLY (Telegram-
; sourced positions always use plain lock-then-trail) - 0 is EXIT_SL_TO_TP1
; (the default, matches AdvisorConfig.exit_style="sl_to_tp1"). Set it to 1
; (EXIT_BREAKEVEN_R_DECAY) only if AdvisorConfig.exit_style is also
; "breakeven_r_decay" - see config.py's module docstring - and keep
; InpBreakevenAtrMult/InpAtrPeriod/InpDecayWindowMinutes in sync with
; breakeven_atr_mult/breakeven_atr_period/decay_window_minutes there by
; hand. InpAtrTimeframe=5 is PERIOD_M5 (MT5's raw ENUM_TIMEFRAMES value).
;
InpEnableTelegramSignals=false
InpEnableClaudeManagement=false
InpFixedLot=0.01
InpMaxPositionsPerDirection=5
InpSlDollars=6.0
InpTp1Dollars=6.0
InpTrailDollars=3.0
InpTelegramMagicNumber=20260922
InpClaudeMagicNumber=20260921
InpDryRun=true
InpExitStyle=0
InpBreakevenAtrMult=0.5
InpAtrTimeframe=5
InpAtrPeriod=14
InpDecayWindowMinutes=15.0
InpBotToken=
InpChannelId1=0
InpChannelId2=0
InpPollSeconds=5
InpHttpTimeoutMs=5000
InpMaxSignalAgeSec=180
InpTradeXAUUSDOnly=true
InpMaxTradesPerDay=0
InpPendingExpiryMin=240
InpMaxEntryDeviationPips=200.0
